Package: flamewm
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ArkFlame Studios <maintainers@arkflame.dev>
Depends: libx11-6, libxi6, libxft2, libfontconfig1, libdbus-1-3, libpulse0, libpam0g, libpam-runtime, python3
Description: FlameWM X11 window manager
 FlameWM is a Rust X11 window manager with native WebRender-compatible UI.
